   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Do The Two**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Get Back**: rare: 13 archived performances [3]\n- **Move On Up**: rare: 11 archived performances [3]\n- **Joy And Pain**: rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2010-04-09.akg461.r44.goldstein.burke.flac24** (recommended): source not stated; 10 songs; 99 min [1]\n- **soulive2010-04-09.akg461.r44.goldstein.burke.flac16**: source not stated; 10 songs; 99 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2010-04-09.akg461.r44.goldstein.burke.flac24**: taped by Brian Goldstein; transferred by Brian Goldstein, Tim Burke; source: 24 bit: AKG CK61/C460B > Edirol R-44 [1]. Also: Recorded with AKG CK61/C460B microphones into an Edirol R-44, then moved from SDHC card to PC and compressed to FLAC; Microphones were on a stand about six feet high, aimed at the speaker stacks; captured at 24-bit, 48 kHz [1]\n- **soulive2010-04-09.akg461.r44.goldstein.burke.flac16**: taped by Brian Goldstein; transferred by Brian Goldstein, Tim Burke; source: 16 bit: AKG CK61/C460B > Edirol R-44 [2]",
